				<p>The Secretary of State makes this <ref class="placeholder" href="#varDocSubType" /> in exercise of the powers conferred by section 123(4)(a) of the Education Act 2002<authorialNote GUID="_7a37fe77-c928-43a9-bbc6-a7921260ccfd" class="footnote" eId="fnote_1" marker="1">
