		<body>
			
			<article GUID="_3fe04e10-d638-4b03-89f2-2f4e22cc5bcd" class="prov1" eId="art_1">
				
				<heading GUID="_b3394026-cb8f-4131-b741-bff0aef8cd9c" eId="art_1__hdg">Citation, commencement and extent</heading>
				<num>1.</num>
				<paragraph GUID="_c1192b91-b37e-4845-b7b2-3ac6e38d2034" class="prov2" eId="art_1__para_1">
					<num>(1)</num>
					<content>
						<p>This Order may be cited as the School Teachers’ Incentive Payments (England) (Amendment) Order 2023 and comes into force on 1st September 2023.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
				<paragraph GUID="_39c9e82f-c9cd-4260-be84-5a27fc53d013" class="prov2" eId="art_1__para_2">
					<num>(2)</num>
					<content>
						<p>This Order extends to England and Wales.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
			</article>
			<article GUID="_2028d841-eff8-476b-92f5-b9f7b01f125c" class="prov1" eId="art_2">
				
				<heading GUID="_2d431e15-977d-48df-a4bc-957e9e765af0" eId="art_2__hdg">Amendment of the School Teachers’ Incentive Payments (England) Order 2019</heading>
				<num>2.</num>
				<paragraph GUID="_7a2fdc79-e5f0-4276-ad39-7303515e54c9" class="prov2" eId="art_2__para_1">
					<num>(1)</num>
					<content>
						<p>The School Teachers’ Incentive Payments (England) Order 2019<authorialNote GUID="_cb5c3c38-d6a8-425a-ae00-e28bb9145404" class="footnote" eId="fnote_2" marker="2">
								<p>S.I. 2019/1133. Article 2(2) is amended by S.I. 2020/690 and by S.I 2022/786.</p>
							</authorialNote> is amended as follows.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
				<paragraph GUID="_cb752597-5b02-4bc1-ad43-d63e312217a2" class="prov2" eId="art_2__para_2">
					<num>(2)</num>
					<intro GUID="_bf2f12c4-888c-491e-9f3e-6bb3627a929b" eId="art_2__para_2__intro">
						<p>In article 2(2) (incentive payments to school teachers)—</p>
					</intro>
					<level GUID="_9d7e8ba5-f304-49c2-904a-0352485b52bf" class="para1" eId="art_2__para_2__para_a">
						<num>(a)</num>
						<content>
							<p>in sub-paragraph (c) omit “and”; and</p>
						</content>
					</level>
					<level GUID="_c662cbd1-a1d3-4583-89ac-42616b1d4e26" class="para1" eId="art_2__para_2__para_b">
						<num>(b)</num>
						<content>
							<p>
								<mod>after sub-paragraph (d) insert—<quotedStructure GUID="_22451913-02f9-4d80-8cfc-7434b554a21f" eId="art_2__para_2__para_b__qstr" endQuote="”" startQuote="“" ukl:context="body" ukl:docName="uksi" ukl:indent="indent0">
										<content>
											<p />
										</content>
									</quotedStructure><inline name="AppendText">“and</inline></mod>
							</p>
						</content>
					</level>
					<level GUID="_43249a28-3dc6-4e53-8eec-451763ca91b5" class="para1" eId="art_2__para_2__para_e">
						<num>(e)</num>
						<content>
							<p>the International <?oxy_comment_start author="catherine.james" timestamp="20230629T125937+0000" comment="Should this be &quot;the International Relocation Payment&quot;, in common with the other items listed in article 2(2) of the 2019 Order?" flag="done"?>Relocation<?oxy_comment_end ?> Payment,”</p>
						</content>
					</level>
				</paragraph>
			</article>
			<hcontainer GUID="_682fc61a-a4db-445c-b3ef-bd0e11edb355" eId="sigs" name="signatures">
				
				<hcontainer GUID="_a290b5fb-cdb7-466b-adad-ea5b529a8b47" eId="sigs__sigBlk" name="signatureBlock">
					<content>
						<block GUID="_c55f32da-df95-4954-a680-d66ebb5aa144" eId="sigs__sigBlk__sig" name="signature">Nick Gibb</block>
						<block GUID="_e3710611-6f7c-430d-920b-294539b0bc57" eId="sigs__sigBlk__role" name="role">Minister of State</block>
						<block name="date"><date date="2023-07-18">18th July 2023</date></block>
						<block GUID="_f83fc74c-01c8-4286-adf8-eaf3da8c496e" eId="sigs__sigBlk__org" name="organization">Department for Education</block>
					</content>
				</hcontainer>
			</hcontainer>
		</body>
		<conclusions GUID="_3fa6dd4a-d3f2-4514-beb9-e0a65f3ece84" eId="backCover">
			
			<blockContainer GUID="_bd88c3c1-229f-4f59-b55b-143dbfe7138b" class="explanatoryNote" eId="backCover__explNote">
				<heading GUID="_a1855822-3283-4231-ab7c-2aa4e166da66" eId="backCover__explNote__hdg">Explanatory Note</heading>
				<subheading GUID="_daa75303-bc71-4f8e-9539-d6a09a6af1aa" eId="backCover__explNote__subhdg">(This note is not part of the <ref class="placeholder" href="#varDocSubType" />)</subheading>
				<p>This Order amends the School Teachers’ Incentive Payments (England) Order 2019 (S.I. 2019/1133).<?oxy_comment_start author="catherine.james" timestamp="20230629T130225+0000" comment="Two comments on the EN:
1) I wonder if it reads better to say &quot;to the list of schemes under which payment is not to be treated as remuneration...&quot;
2) I might be inclined to put something about the application of the instrument, such as &quot;The 2019 Order only applies to school teachers in England, and so the amendments made by this Order have the same application.&quot;  If you do that you&apos;d want to define &quot;the 2019 Order&quot; in brackets after its title in the first/second lines of the EN." id="x14_pdh_1yb" flag="done"?><?oxy_comment_end ?><?oxy_comment_start author="humaira.bajwa" timestamp="20230705T142842+0000" parentID="x14_pdh_1yb" comment="Thank you. I have accepted #1 but not #2  - it hasn&apos;t been raised  as an issue before in previous amendments to the 2019 Order" flag="done" mid="2"?>I<?oxy_comment_end mid="2"?>t adds the International Relocation Payment to the list of schemes under which payment is not to be treated as remuneration for the purposes of section 122(1) of the Education Act 2002 (c. 32).</p>
				<p>An impact assessment has not been produced for this instrument as it has no impact on business or civil society organisations. The instrument has minimal impact on the public sector.</p>
			</blockContainer>
		</conclusions>
